    "text": "(Kashaev–Murakami–Murakami Volume Conjecture). For a\nlink $L \\subset S^{3}$,\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2\\pi}\\operatorname{Vol}_{\\mathrm{hyp}}(S^{3}-L)\n=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{1}{n}\\log\\left|J_{n}\\bigl(L,e^{2\\pi i/n}\\bigr)\\right|.\n$$",
